+      - Relative dB VAD
+    heading_slug: relative-db-vad
+    line_span:
+      - 255
+      - 269
+    section_hash: 4993606f2e9632dcff127ea71c151e1483828aa9a2adc1fe752a5887022e9562
+    summary: Relative dB VAD
+    text:
+      "### Relative dB VAD\n\nBest for general audio with relative threshold:\n\n\
+      ```python\nfrom audiosig import relative_db_vad\n\nactivity = relative_db_vad(\n\
+      \    audio,\n    frame_length=2048,\n    hop_length=512,\n    threshold_db=40.0,\
+      \         # dB below peak\n)\n```"
+    links: []
+  - section_id: md:section:docs/getting-started.md::unified-interface
+    doc_path: docs/getting-started.md
+    heading_path:
+      - Getting Started with AudioSig
+      - Voice Activity Detection (VAD)
+      - Unified Interface
+    heading_slug: unified-interface
+    line_span:
+      - 270
+      - 283
+    section_hash: 9fabe9eea219872e83cbb9b0205d0e4782969dc28702e0f5ac9268e856bb8879
+    summary: Unified Interface
+    text: "### Unified Interface
+
+
+      The `energy_based_vad` function selects the algorithm based on parameters:
+
+
+      ```python
+
+      from audiosig import energy_based_vad
+
+
+      # With sample_rate → normalized energy VAD
+
+      activity = energy_based_vad(audio, sample_rate=24000)
+
+
+      # Without sample_rate → relative dB VAD
+
+      activity = energy_based_vad(audio, frame_length=2048, hop_length=512)
+
+      ```"
+    links: []
