+    summary: trim()
+    text:
+      "### trim()\n\nRemoves leading and trailing silence:\n\n```python\nfrom audiosig\
+      \ import trim\n\ntrimmed, interval = trim(\n    audio,\n    top_db=40.0,     \
+      \     # Silence threshold in dB\n    frame_length=2048,    # Analysis frame size\n\
+      \    hop_length=128,       # Hop size\n)\n\n# interval is [start, end] sample\
+      \ indices\nprint(f\"Trimmed from sample {interval[0]} to {interval[1]}\")\n```"
+    links: []
+  - section_id: md:section:docs/getting-started.md::split
+    doc_path: docs/getting-started.md
+    heading_path:
+      - Getting Started with AudioSig
+      - Silence Trimming
